{"2791900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Foul", "steam_appid": 2791900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/e79faf96637c806a1e690fb521da0ba7.avif?t=1787480466\" width=1560 height=325 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOUL IS A SURVIVAL GAME WITH STORY ELEMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world you once knew has ceased to exist. Now, left on your own, you must face everything that stands in your way. Contaminated animals, hunger, and darkness are just some of the threats you’ll encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT INFECTED CREATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in intense battles against enemies lurking around every corner. A wide variety of melee and ranged weapons will help you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/d802a32b70bd73e1ff866eac73c9c6b0.poster.avif?t=1787480466\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/d802a32b70bd73e1ff866eac73c9c6b0.webm?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/d802a32b70bd73e1ff866eac73c9c6b0.mp4?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRIVE FREELY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this lawless world, every car belongs to you. The only things that can stop you are your driving skills and your fuel supply. Vehicles allow you to travel quickly across the world and can also deal serious damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/980e23bf4a48a18763d2460ac3e60d6a.poster.avif?t=1787480466\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/980e23bf4a48a18763d2460ac3e60d6a.webm?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/980e23bf4a48a18763d2460ac3e60d6a.mp4?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR BASE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no truly safe places in this world, but having a shelter is always better than none. With different types of buildings, your base can be a simple camp or a massive villa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/590a571ea448b98a7d006e533a520fe4.poster.avif?t=1787480466\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/590a571ea448b98a7d006e533a520fe4.webm?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/590a571ea448b98a7d006e533a520fe4.mp4?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR CHARACTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your appearance — from hairstyle to clothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/740eb4d5ec4bb46758796f55117328eb.poster.avif?t=1787480466\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/740eb4d5ec4bb46758796f55117328eb.webm?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/740eb4d5ec4bb46758796f55117328eb.mp4?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE DIVERSE LOCATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is filled with interesting places, each still holding a fragment of its former glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/ce63cc079d538a1848abc97876a42496.poster.avif?t=1787480466\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/ce63cc079d538a1848abc97876a42496.webm?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/ce63cc079d538a1848abc97876a42496.mp4?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GATHER VARIOUS RESOURCES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map is rich in resources that can be used to construct buildings, as well as craft better tools and armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/2d0265a7e9927beb9122580632c914a8.poster.avif?t=1787480466\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/2d0265a7e9927beb9122580632c914a8.webm?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/2d0265a7e9927beb9122580632c914a8.mp4?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SEARCH FOR WATER, FOOD, AND OTHER SUPPLIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic needs are not guaranteed in this world. Resources are scarce, and the search for them never ends. Fortunately, no one will mind if you borrow some...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/0fd2d3e376e13bb427d06a2405047e39.poster.avif?t=1787480466\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/0fd2d3e376e13bb427d06a2405047e39.webm?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/0fd2d3e376e13bb427d06a2405047e39.mp4?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/e79faf96637c806a1e690fb521da0ba7.avif?t=1787480466\" width=1560 height=325 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOUL IS A SURVIVAL GAME WITH STORY ELEMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world you once knew has ceased to exist. Now, left on your own, you must face everything that stands in your way. Contaminated animals, hunger, and darkness are just some of the threats you’ll encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT INFECTED CREATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in intense battles against enemies lurking around every corner. A wide variety of melee and ranged weapons will help you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/d802a32b70bd73e1ff866eac73c9c6b0.poster.avif?t=1787480466\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/d802a32b70bd73e1ff866eac73c9c6b0.webm?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/d802a32b70bd73e1ff866eac73c9c6b0.mp4?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRIVE FREELY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this lawless world, every car belongs to you. The only things that can stop you are your driving skills and your fuel supply. Vehicles allow you to travel quickly across the world and can also deal serious damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/980e23bf4a48a18763d2460ac3e60d6a.poster.avif?t=1787480466\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/980e23bf4a48a18763d2460ac3e60d6a.webm?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/980e23bf4a48a18763d2460ac3e60d6a.mp4?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR BASE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no truly safe places in this world, but having a shelter is always better than none. With different types of buildings, your base can be a simple camp or a massive villa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/590a571ea448b98a7d006e533a520fe4.poster.avif?t=1787480466\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/590a571ea448b98a7d006e533a520fe4.webm?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/590a571ea448b98a7d006e533a520fe4.mp4?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR CHARACTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your appearance — from hairstyle to clothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/740eb4d5ec4bb46758796f55117328eb.poster.avif?t=1787480466\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/740eb4d5ec4bb46758796f55117328eb.webm?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/740eb4d5ec4bb46758796f55117328eb.mp4?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE DIVERSE LOCATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is filled with interesting places, each still holding a fragment of its former glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/ce63cc079d538a1848abc97876a42496.poster.avif?t=1787480466\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/ce63cc079d538a1848abc97876a42496.webm?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791900/extras/ce63cc079d538a1848abc97876a42496.mp4?t=1787480466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>